== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Gnome Wizard of Bertoxxulous, you will have an Old Folded Letter in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: In the mirror of this wretched society, we await. . .the time grows ever near, for us to shatter these rose-colored visions of Ak'Anon's citizens, and let their eyes fall upon the image of our true selves. The Dark Reflection readies its soldiers of Bertoxxulous, hidden away deep beneath Ak'Anon, in the Mines of Malfunction. [[Velena Corgtec]] is your new master now. . .do not keep him waiting.

Upon handing the note to [[Velena Corgtec]]:

: [[Velena Corgtec]] says, 'A new wizard pledging to our cause is always welcome. Take this robe and we'll begin your training.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Dark Reflection]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Eldritch Collective]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Gem Choppers]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Deep Muses]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Dark Gold Felt Robe*]]. Good luck, Wizard!

